  "description": "<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"322\">De Minecraft Alex Amiibo is een officiële <strong data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"107\">verzamel- en gamefiguur</strong> van Nintendo, gebaseerd op het populaire personage Alex uit Minecraft. Deze Amiibo kan worden gebruikt op compatibele Nintendo-consoles voor extra in-game content en functies, afhankelijk van de ondersteunde games.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"450\">Naast functioneel is deze Amiibo ook zeer geschikt als verzamelobject of decoratie voor liefhebbers van Minecraft en Nintendo.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"455\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"468\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"487\"><strong data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"487\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"492\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"509\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<li data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"542\">\r\n<p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"542\">🧱 Officiële Nintendo Amiibo</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"597\">🎮 Ontgrendelt extra content in ondersteunde games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"633\">🧍 Populair Minecraft-personage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"668\">🏆 Geschikt als verzamelobject</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"704\">📦 Originele Nintendo-kwaliteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"731\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<li data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"755\">Producttype: Amiibo</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"776\">Serie: Minecraft</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"796\">Personage: Alex</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"851\">\r\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"851\">Compatibiliteit: Nintendo Switch / Wii U / New 3DS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"876\">Materiaal: Kunststof</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"928\">\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"928\">Functie: In-game extra’s (afhankelijk van game)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"954\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"979\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<li data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<p data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1006\">Nintendo Amiibo figuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1037\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1074\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1074\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
